{"articleNo":"2600","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2600&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010-2학기 학기제 현장실습 및 지원비 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.08.12","hit":"12971","attachments":[{"name":"2010-2학기 학기제현장실습 신청.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2600&attachNo=1838"},{"name":"2010 교육역량강화사업의 국내산업체 인턴십 지원 안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2600&attachNo=1871"},{"name":"그린에너지시스템 재학생인턴지원안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2600&attachNo=1983"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2010-2 학기제현장실습 및 지원비 신청안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">1. 이수대상</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : 3학년 이상 재학생(재학중 1회에 한함.)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2. 이수시기</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : 해당 학기 내 실시</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">3. 이수기간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : 15주 이상(법정근로시간)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">4. 이수신청</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : “학기제현장실습신청서”를 작성하여 해당 학부 행정실에 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">5. 신청기간 : 2010. 8 16(월) ~ 2010. 8. 20(금)까지 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">6. 대상업체</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">(해당 학부 종합학사행정실 문의)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 학교나 학부단위의 산학연계 결연업체</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학부장이 추천하는 전공과 관련이 있는 업체</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">다. 학부장이 추천하는 업체 이외에 학생이 선정하는 전공과 관련이 있는 업체</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 118.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -118.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">7. 결과보고서 제출 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">현장실습결과보고서 및 실습일지 등을 실습을 종료한 후 5일</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">이내에 학사행정실로 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">8. 수강신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">가. 주간수업은 신청할 수 없음</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">나. 실습기관이 출퇴근 거리를 벗어난 경우 등은 수강신청할 수 없음.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">다. 실습대상자로 허가된 학생은 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">교무연구과에서 일괄 수강신청</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 75.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -75.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">9. 성적처리</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : 현장실습 합격자는 S, 불합격자는 U로 평가되며, U로 평가받은 성적은 기록하지 않음.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 75.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -75.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">10. 학기제 현장실습 이수자에 한하여 학기제 현장실습 지원내역을 다음과 같이 안내하오니 많은 학생들이 현장실습에 참여하여, 지원비를 지원 받</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">을 수 있도록 신청하시기 바랍니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">가. 지원비 지원 내역</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">(신청서식 및 지원상세 내역은 첨부물 참조)\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"126\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">사 업 명</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"99\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">지원(기준)금액</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"235\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">대 상 자</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"103\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">신청서식</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"126\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">교육역량강화사업</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"99\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">1,000,000원&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"235\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">전 학부 재학생</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"103\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">첨부 서식 활용</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"126\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">그린에너지시스템</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">인재양성사업</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"99\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">1,000,000원</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"235\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">그린에너지시스템 인재양성사업 참여 학생</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"103\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">첨부 서식 활용</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"></span></p>\n<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">나. 신청기간 : 2010. 8 16(월) ~ 2010. 8. 20(금)까지 </span><p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">(학기제현장실습 <font size=\"2\">신청일에 같이 신청</font>)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">다. 신청서류 제출 : 학기제현장실습 양식은 공통으로 제출하되, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">교육역량강화사업 또는 그린에너지시스템 인재양성센터지원비 중 택일하여 학생이 지원받기 원하는 분야로 지원신청하되, 신청안내문을 숙지한 후 신청하시기 바람</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">☞ 취업자 및 이중지원자는 지원대상자에서 제외<br>(지원대상에서 제외되는 경우 학기제현장실습 신청서만 제출) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 81pt; TEXT-INDENT: -81pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 92pt; TEXT-INDENT: -92pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">11. 문의전화</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : 478-7029(교무연구과)로 문의하시고 학부(과)별 문의사항은 첨부물 참조<br><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;2010. 8. 12<br><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"5\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;교무연구과장</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
